    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[68ch] space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary">
      <p>For years I asked the wrong question whenever a client succeeded: "what made their diet the winner?" The better question is what their plan had in common with every other plan that worked. Strip the brand names off the five healthiest diets, or the five longest-lived towns, and the same five fundamentals are running underneath. You can swap between them freely.</p>
    </div>

