    </div>

    <aside class="not-prose mx-auto my-10 max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-sage/40 bg-sage/5 px-6 py-5 sm:px-8">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sage-dark mb-2">In short</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary">If a plan covers all five and you can keep it up, the label on it matters much less.</p>
    </aside>
